 "What is missing in the following sentence?\n\nTo make a delicious soup, Alice requires $3$ grams of ginger powder and $4$ grams of garlic powder, among other ingredients, so she needs $\\boxed{}$ grams of ginger powder for each gram of garlic." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518106 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "0b38d5e8-3d9c-538c-a4ad-3e7a464487ac" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518106 #edb/ref 1074 "The ratio of the number of grams of ginger powder to the number of grams of garlic powder is  $3:4.$ \n\nWe can rewrite this ratio as a fraction, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{4}\n$$\n\nThis means that there is $\\frac{3}{4}$ grams of ginger powder for each gram of garlic powder." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518172 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186517988 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518172 #edb/ref 1069 "q-60256" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518172 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518172 #edb/ref 1071 "![](images/06/06931fae92045635d523614dce24063856209b1f04987471b9de183a3ccce4a2.png)\n\nIf the ratio of rhombuses to total shapes is $\\frac{3}{\\boxed{}}$ then what is the missing number?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518172 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "8c4f25cf-0173-54ec-98c6-ab10b632fa9a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518172 #edb/ref 1074 "We count the number of rhombuses. We see that there are $3$ rhombuses.\n\n We count the total number of shapes. We see that there are $7$ shapes.\n\nHence, the ratio of circles to triangles is$\\frac{3}{7}$\n\nSo the missing number is $7.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518223 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186518051 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518223 #edb/ref 1069 "q-60250" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518223 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518223 #edb/ref 1071 "From left to right, what are the missing numbers in the following sentence?\n\nA student makes a mixture having $\\frac{4}{9}$ grams of ginger for each gram of glucose to make his own energy drink. Therefore, the energy drink has a ratio of $\\boxed{}$ grams of ginger to $\\boxed{}$ grams of glucose." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518223 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "fed5c231-48f8-530b-a66d-407d2c45633b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518223 #edb/ref 1074 "Let's rewrite the fraction $\\frac{4}{9}$ as a ratio:\n\n$$\n4:9\n$$\n\nTherefore, the energy drink has a ratio of $4$ grams of ginger to $9$ grams of glucose." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518242 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186518261 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518242 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "37ee238c-3593-502f-845f-f9c2b74cd9d1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518242 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186518106 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518247 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "4104b582-02c9-5a3d-a68c-63888ab13e51" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518247 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186518172 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518261 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186518247 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518261 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "73d398fa-e284-584b-af53-0ec2a7adc313" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186518261 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186518223 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
